[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16621.91, "timestamp": "04:37:01", "text": "我检查一下？是吗？是的。好的。那么，为什么是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16626.99, "timestamp": "04:37:06", "text": "有两秒钟吗？二。哦，不。二。二"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16631.31, "timestamp": "04:37:11", "text": "第二。 8秒。我的天哪。 8秒。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16633.15, "timestamp": "04:37:13", "text": "弗里克。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16638.31, "timestamp": "04:37:18", "text": "另一个问题是：为什么会有这个问题？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16644.99, "timestamp": "04:37:24", "text": "第二？另一个是寿司。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16646.99, "timestamp": "04:37:26", "text": "龙。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16651.83, "timestamp": "04:37:31", "text": "呃，寿司龙。寿司龙。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16658.59, "timestamp": "04:37:38", "text": "男。他的一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16663.551, "timestamp": "04:37:43", "text": "做。我喜欢特效之类的东西。就是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16666.109, "timestamp": "04:37:46", "text": "所以就是这样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16671.91, "timestamp": "04:37:51", "text": "令人难以置信。想象一下。一切"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16675.949, "timestamp": "04:37:55", "text": "通过 OBS 等设备进行实时直播"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16679.83, "timestamp": "04:37:59", "text": "只有他一个人。他就是那个人"}]